</video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office Lifestyle:</strong> Engage in hilarious pranks. If you get caught, your social credit decreases, but if you succeed, you earn double the points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Downtown:</strong> Cruise around Downtown to discover other ways to earn cash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization Options: </strong>Use various options to customize your hair, accessories, colors, and more!</p></li></ul>",
